# `cdk synth -o <dir>` / `cdk deploy -o <dir>` write assemblies to a suffixed directory, which
# .gitignore already covers as cdk.out.* . Without the same pattern here, one such directory
# makes prettier-check report ~1900 generated CloudFormation templates as unformatted.
cdk.out.*
# CDK writes this context cache itself on every synth/deploy, in its own formatting, and it is tracked
# so the cached lookups are reproducible. Formatting it only holds until the next synth, so leaving it
# in scope makes prettier-check fail after any deploy. Path-anchored, so it excludes this one generated
# file rather than every cdk.context.json at any depth.
infra/cdk.context.json
