# The repo-root review/planning register only (gitignored, local-only). ANCHORED with a leading
# slash: a bare `docs` carries no path separator, so it matches a directory of that name at EVERY
# depth — which silently excluded all 135 pages of documentation/docusaurus-site/docs as well. That
# is invisible in CI, because `prettier --check` reports "All matched files use Prettier code style!"
# after matching zero files. Confirm a page is reachable with `prettier --file-info <path>`, which
# answers `"ignored": true` rather than pretending to have checked it.
/docs
.plans
web/e2e/.auth
web/e2e/.report
